1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
And now, for the final match of the selection exam, Rill, Mills, and Ruben of Team I, come forth!

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Here, Master Rill, please enjoy a nice cup of herbal tea to clear your mind and boost your creative focus.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Yay! Thanks so much!

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
When your mother hears of your accomplishments, I'm certain she'll be overjoyed and beaming with pride.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Yeah? She'll be proud? You think so?

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Indeed, Master.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Then I've definitely gotta win this.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,000
You are the illustrious captain of the Aqua Deer. Show no mercy in proving that to the enemy.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
It's the final match and he's still cool as a cucumber. I guess that's typical for Captain Rill, though.

13
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
He has been winning by landslide this entire time.

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
He's been carrying our team ever since the tournament began.

15
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
We might get picked to be Royal Knights just because of his amazing performance.

16
