38
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:45,000
All right! Now I get a chance to shine!

39
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,000
What'd he say? Does that mean he's been holding back until now?

40
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
So cool. I wish I could be like that too.

41
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,000
