51
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Here we go.

52
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,000
This is the match that will decide the winner.

53
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Though I myself won't be playing a starring role, I expect a beautiful performance.

54
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,000
I want to reach new heights from now on, so I won't take my eyes off the action for a second!

55
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,000
