00:17:09,660 --> 00:17:13,340
I am certain that is what Madam would want for you.

275
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:17,340
I think so, too.

276
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,960
Thanks for your help, Walt.

277
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:20,340
And you know?

278
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:22,180
Thank you.

279
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:23,340
Ah!

280
00:17:24,300 --> 00:17:25,780
Sweet, sweet victory!

281
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,600
We flexed our muscles!

282
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:28,520
That was great.

283
00:17:28,620 --> 00:17:29,200
Of course.

284
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:30,260
What'd you expect?

285
00:17:30,620 --> 00:17:30,960
No!

286
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,260
Oh my gosh!

287
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:34,400
I can't believe we actually did it!

288
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:39,840
The Royal Knights' Selection Exam is now over.

289
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,500
Good work, Team P.

290
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,660
My congratulations.

291
00:17:44,820 --> 00:17:46,660
And regardless of the result,

292
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:49,140
you all should be proud of winning the semifinal.

293
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:55,200
Oh, and just because the other teams were eliminated along the way,

294
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:57,260
that doesn't mean anyone's out of the running.

295
00:17:57,680 --> 00:18:02,120
We're going to give each individual contestant's performance a comprehensive review,

296
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:05,720
and then we'll select 10 to 20 Royal Knights at a later date.

297
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:06,780
Oh!

298
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:07,940
Awesome!

299
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:09,520
That means I've still got a shot!

300
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:13,220
Everyone here is a remarkably talented Magic Knight.

301
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:15,780
It won't be an easy decision, that's for sure.

302
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:19,720
In closing, we have a special message from the King.

303
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:21,240
Ahem!

304
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:24,260
You have all done exceedingly well.

305
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:26,820
Exchanging sophisticated spells,

306
00:18:27,140 --> 00:18:30,800
your uncanny ability to adapt and innovate in a variety of situations,

307
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:34,580
and, of course, your keen execution of precise battle strategies.

308
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:38,460
Really, any team here could have been the one to emerge victorious from where I'm sitting.

309
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,140
He sounds like a real king.

310
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,300
So proper.

311
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:42,340
Maybe too proper.

312
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:44,240
This doesn't seem right somehow.

313
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:45,360
However!

314
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:48,040
I still worked harder than any of you!

315
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:50,600
If not for me, there would be no tournament!

316
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:54,860
I was the one who announced that the strongest would be selected to join the Royal Knights!

317
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:57,820
I am single-handedly responsible for this whole event!

318
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:59,240
What are you waiting for?!

319
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,600
Shower me with praise!

320
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:05,720
Thank you, Your Majesty, but please relax.

321
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:09,120
We're all here because we heartily endorse the appointment of the Royal Knights

322
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:10,500
and eagerly await the announcement.

323
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,520
Look, think about it this way.

324
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:16,100
These warriors are devoting themselves to defeating the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

325
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:18,720
And isn't that far more rewarding than any praise?

326
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:22,860
The Wizard King is so much better.

327
00:19:22,940 --> 00:19:24,620
If only he was the one ruling us!

328
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,820
Can't we just make him the king from now on?

329
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:32,300
Now then, whoever makes it into the Royal Knights, I'll be counting on you!

330
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:33,000
Sir!

331
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:35,560
Curse you, Julius!

332
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:37,880
You're always hugging the spotlight!

333
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:42,080
And with that, the Royal Knights selection exam is now complete!

334
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:45,320
Well, that's that.

335
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:47,640
I'd say today's contest was a success.

336
00:19:48,280 --> 00:19:48,720
Indeed.

337
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:50,640
It fulfilled your other goal, too.

338
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:56,100
We've potentially discovered the Magic Knight being used as a puppet by the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

339
00:19:57,840 --> 00:20:01,200
As soon as Longris recovers, we'll conduct a full investigation.

340
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:06,900
I don't want to make everyone a suspect, but there may be more to come.

341
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:10,980
We can't let our guard down.

342
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:14,440
Thanks for staying with me, Mimosa.

343
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:16,440
Yes, of course.

344
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:21,900
My magic may be able to heal wounds of the body, but wounds of the spirit...

345
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:23,840
Ready?

346
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:24,900
We're leaving.

347
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:25,840
You know!

348
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:27,080
What?

349
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:27,940
Now?

350
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:29,440
I see.

351
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:30,540
Asta.

352
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:32,540
You've done enough.

353
00:20:32,820 --> 00:20:34,040
I can look after him now.

354
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:36,540
Um, I mean, don't take it the wrong way!

355
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:38,300
Yeah, squad mates are supposed to help each other!

356
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:39,720
That's all I'm talking about!

357
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:46,920
You know...

358
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:49,060
You don't want to say goodbye, at least?

359
00:20:49,900 --> 00:20:50,380
You know!

360
00:20:52,220 --> 00:20:53,920
I will catch up to you!

361
00:20:54,220 --> 00:20:55,980
I will be the Wizard King!

362
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:56,760
I swear!

363
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:01,520
I don't feel like being caught up to...

364
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:02,400
Hey, slow down!

365
00:21:02,420 --> 00:21:02,680
No!

366
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,600
I'm friends!

367
00:21:06,540 --> 00:21:15,920
You made this?

368
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:21,260
Sure, he may be a little rough around the edges, but the important thing is that he's a man of his word!

369
00:21:21,340 --> 00:21:23,680
A warrior who's secretly protecting his country!

370
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:27,880
We trust each other like lifelong friends and face death together every day!

371
00:21:29,140 --> 00:21:29,640
Friends.

372
00:21:30,180 --> 00:21:30,660
Trust.

373
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:35,080
Now, those aren't things I think about too often.

374
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:36,080
Leaving already?

375
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:37,080
Yeah.

376
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:41,500
Thank you for telling those who lost their battles where they went wrong.

377
00:21:42,500 --> 00:21:49,040
While I can't applaud the manner in which you did, I'm certain those who wish to grow will heed your advice and be stronger for it.

378
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:53,420
We need your trap magic and your ability to think critically.

379
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:56,800
The exam is done, and you likely passed.

380
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:57,860
I hope you'll join.

381
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,500
